uan-ii">Tangaxuan II</a> executed on 14 February</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1536</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/vasco-de-quiroga">Vasco de Quiroga</a> is appointed the first <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bishop">bishop</a> of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/michoacan">Michoacán</a></span></li></ol>
